    narr:narration """The narrative surrounding [decision capture at the point of consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has transitioned from a foundational product thesis established in March 2026 to a phase of concrete validation. By August 2026, the focus shifted toward identifying [sprint-based evidence](narr:Position_SprintFourEvidenceOfThesis) to substantiate the core differentiator. This trajectory is marked by the successful deployment of the [async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787045470058_1) and the identification of the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787045470058_3) as a critical technical unlock. The current span captures a move from theoretical product positioning toward empirical verification of the async workflow's efficacy.""" ;
